# Shopping Website

A simple and professional static shopping website built using **HTML and CSS**. The website provides a clean interface for browsing and displaying shopping products.

## Features

* Clean and responsive design
* Product listing section
* Product images and details
* Navigation bar
* Shopping categories
* Simple and user-friendly interface

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3

## How to Run

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open `index.html` in any web browser.

## Purpose

This project was created to practice front-end web development using HTML and CSS and to build a simple static shopping website.

